20.16.36.m:
Regarding the smearing around of the fire-hearths:
The sutra is of the two Teachers.
Regarding this, Aupamanyava used to say: 'He should smear around only the single hearth of the gārhapatya fire;

20.18.40.m:
Regarding the giving of sacrificial fees:
The sutra is of Śālīki.
Regarding this, Baudhāyana used to say: 'He should make all these offerings accompanied by sacrificial fees;

Regarding the combination of procedures:
There is no combination of procedures according to the two Teachers.
Regarding this, Aupamanyava used to say: 'The eight-potsherd cake for Agni [and the offering] to Agni Pavamāna should be the first procedure;

Regarding the giving of sacrificial fees:
The sutra is of Śālīki;
that of Baudhāyana has been stated.
